author ai
file crates/gui/src/palette.rs
symbol impl Score
lines 0 19
hash 45f172bf02a9add1
note The weights: a contiguous match (1000) outranks any scattered one; a word start adds 300, the very start 100, the whole name 400; a scattered letter scores 10, 15 more when it follows the previous directly and 20 at a word start, minus its distance from the previous letter up to 10. Tours, steps, views and actions get 50 over symbols and files, enough to win a tie of equal matches and no more.

